an><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\"><img alt=\"Northern Pike\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Northern_Pike_8e10b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\"><img alt=\"Rainbow Trout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rainbow_Trout_b08ae9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\"><img alt=\"Green Perch\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Perch_8933ab.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Map nibelor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"108\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_nibelor_07aea3.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.00<br/>June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Nibelor</b> is a small island to the north-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>. The powerful spirit guardians of Svargrond have established themselves there and are often meditating and increasing their power. The surface of this island isn't a real good hunting place, since it has only little and weak monsters. Two holes in the southern part of the island (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32356,31087,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32356, 31087, 7)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32388,31075,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32388, 31075, 7)</a>) lead to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor%20Ice%20Cave\">Nibelor Ice Cave</a> which is inhabited by <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Golem\">Ice Golems</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\">Crystal Spiders</a>.\n</p><p>In order to access this island you can do so by asking for a \"passage\" to <a href=\"#/wiki/Iskan\">Iskan</a> though you might need to do something for him first. If you wish to return to Svargrond you must ask for \"passage\" to <a href=\"#/wiki/Nilsor\">Nilsor</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Nibelor NPCs (3 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Hjaern\">Hjaern</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Hjaern\"><img alt=\"Hjaern\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hjaern_b304f9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Shaman</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Nibelor</strong>, in a cave to the north.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Nilsor\">Nilsor</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Nilsor\"><img alt=\"Nilsor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Nilsor_d9e4ff.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Shaman</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Nibelor</strong>, west of the stone circle.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Siflind\">Siflind</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Siflind\"><img alt=\"Siflind\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"